Package: milou
Version: @DEB_MILOU_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: KDE
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://invent.kde.org/plasma/milou
Depends: qt6-base, qt6-declarative, kf6-config, kf6-i18n, kf6-runner, kf6-svg, libplasma
Replaces: plasma-mobile (<< 6.1.5+ios22)
Breaks: plasma-mobile (<< 6.1.5+ios22)
Description: KRunner-backed Plasma search interface for Xios
 Milou provides the real org.kde.milou QML plugin, ResultsModel, and result
 views used by Plasma Mobile search. This replaces the earlier inert QML
 compatibility fallback, so search results can be queried and activated.
